The opportunity

At EY-Parthenon, our unique combination of transformative strategy, transactions, tax and corporate finance delivers real-world value – solutions that work in practice, not just on paper. Benefiting from EY’s full spectrum of services, we’ve reimagined strategic consulting to work in a world of increasing complexity. With deep functional and sector expertise, paired with innovative AI-powered technology and an investor mindset, we partner with CEOs, boards, private equity and governments every step of the way.

Your key responsibilities

Evaluate financial, accounting, and fundamental data to extract actionable insights using suitable analytical methods

Conduct industry and equity research and analyze information obtained from various channels;

Conduct valuation analyses for a range of purposes, such as financial reporting, strategic management planning, risk management, M&A and compliance with regulatory requirements;

Develop and analyze complex financial models and perform financial analyses and provide actionable insights to clients;

Appraise company or asset values (financial instruments, property and other fixed asset) by building a model from scratch;

Develop presentations and proposals tailored for internal and external events, including prospective client engagements and business development opportunities.

