Strong analytical and logical thinking abilities;

Ability to develop financial models that meet market standards from scratch and present analysis in a clear and logical manner to clients;

Strong sense of ownership and commitment to deliver high quality of work;

Self-driven initiatives and willingness to accept challenges with positive energy;

Effective communication skills in both spoken and written English and Chinese (both Cantonese and Mandarin); and

Strong Microsoft, Excel and PowerPoint knowledge and good report-writing skills

What we offer you

At EY, we’ll develop you with future-focused skills and equip you with world-class experiences. We’ll empower you in a flexible environment, and fuel you and your extraordinary talents in a diverse and inclusive culture of globally connected teams.

If you can confidently demonstrate that you meet the criteria above, please contact us as soon as possible.

